BrowsingDataSaleNotification "Journalists found out that {0} was selling its customers' browsing history"
ComplianceTheaterNotification "An auditor found that the compliance dashboards in {0} were showing green whatever was happening"
DataCollectionNotification "Journalists found out that {0} was selling customer traffic data, which will hurt your market recognition"
DefaultCredsNotification "Botnet operators found the default admin credentials in {0}. Customers are not amused"
EscrowedVaultKeysNotification "Researchers found that {0} quietly keeps a copy of every customer's vault key"
ExploitStockpileNotification "It turns out that {0} sold the vulnerabilities it found before telling anyone. Customers stayed exposed"
ExposedDebugPortNotification "Researchers found a factory debug port left open on {0}"
PredictableSeedNotification "Researchers showed that the keys generated by {0} can be predicted"
RubberStampNotification "{0} issued certificates without checking who was asking. Browsers have started to distrust it"
